{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what they set:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: 0.1),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: 0.5),","])"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; one no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler applies to is always kept and carries no key. Each dropped record is reported on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The decisions come from the tracker’s sampling seed, the same on every platform and Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"release: with a seed fixed, which events are kept is fixed too. Each sampler draws from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream of its own, picked by its place in the tracker’s list: appending a sampler changes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other’s decisions, but inserting, removing or reordering one gives every sampler after it a new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream, so it decides differently under the same seed.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/grouped(by:where:rate:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","title":"Type Methods"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Sampler.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Sampler.swift#L28"},"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Sampler"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler/events(where:rate:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A sampler that keeps each record "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"selects"},{"type":"text","text":" returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" for with probability "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rate"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deciding each on its own."}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"events","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rate","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SampleRate","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers10SampleRateV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","title":"events(where:rate:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler\/events(where:rate:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/SampleRateKey":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key of the rate a record was kept at, which a tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s set on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the context of every record they keep."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampleratekey","title":"SampleRateKey","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keywo